OL,4,CBeatles venue may not play live music  
OL,5,Con rooftop                             
OL,6,GPlans to create a museum where The     
OL,7,GBeatles performed their last live      
OL,8,Gperformance is expected to be approved 
OL,9,G- but on condition no live music can   
OL,10,Gbe played on the rooftop that made the 
OL,11,GMayfair venue famous.                  
OL,13,FApple Corps Ltd, the company founded   
OL,14,Fby the band, wants to convert 3 Savile 
OL,15,FRow into a seven-floor "cultural       
OL,16,Fexperience and exhibition" celebrating 
OL,17,FThe Beatles, with a basement cafe-bar  
OL,18,Fon the site of the studio where Let It 
OL,19,FBe was recorded in 1969.               
